# Modern quick-practice acceptance.
# The title-owned practice router supplies only short A-button pulses after
# observing each proven stock frontend state. This script supplies no gameplay
# input; it only observes the authoritative route and return.
until 009F == D7 3600
dump practice-main-menu
until 0313 == 01 3600
dump practice-race-entered
until 009F == D7 3600
wait 30
dump practice-returned-main
quit
